      "text": "10 月我国原煤产量为 3.70 亿吨，同比仅增长 1.2%，环比则下降 4.3%，国内煤炭产量已基本无增长空间",
      "source": "雪球",
      "reply_count": 64,
      "retweet_count": 10,
      "like_count": 194,
      "view_count": 0,
      "is_retweet": false,
      "retweeted_status": null
    },
    {
      "id": 235869629,
      "url": "https://xueqiu.com/8790885129/235869629",
      "created_at": "2022-11-20T21:00:24+08:00",
      "created_at_ms": 1668949224000,
      "author": {
        "id": 8790885129,
        "screen_name": "超级鹿鼎公"
      },
      "title": "",
      "text": "很多网友的煤炭行业专业水平都大大超过我，甩我几条大街啊",
      "source": "雪球",
      "reply_count": 23,
